        <mxCell id="raRQFdQsiKbz0KAO8EUM-36" value="&lt;font color=&quot;#ff3333&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;ProbCOMB_LEVES.m&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;div&gt;Esta função faz a probabilidade entre os&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;anos modelos, considerando&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;os grupos de combustível &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;para a categoria dos &lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;veículos leves.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;Exemplo:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;Entre os anos de 1982 e 2002 só haviam veículos a álcool e gasolina (não existia veículos flex), logo, deve-se considerar veículos apenas desses dois tipo de combustível. A divisão entre a quantidade de veículos de cada tipo de combustível pela soma dos dois tipo de combustível é a probabilidade.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;A mesma coisa acontece entre os anos de 2003 e 2006, onde existem fatores de emissão para veículos à Gasolina, Etanol, Flex Gasolina e Flex Etanol.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;A partir de 2007 não há veículos somente a Etanol. Então a nova proporção da probabilidade é considerando veículos que consomem Gasolina, Flex Gasolina e Flex Etanol.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#cc00cc&quot;&gt;OUTPUT:&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#cc00cc&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#cc00cc&quot;&gt;FUELTYPE_LEVES82&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#cc00cc&quot;&gt;FUELTYPE_LEVES2003&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#cc00cc&quot;&gt;FUELTYPE_LEVES2007&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#cc00cc&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#cc00cc&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="ellipse;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;strokeColor=#FF3333;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="-1270" y="5710" width="717.19" height="540" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="raRQFdQsiKbz0KAO8EUM-37" value="&lt;font color=&quot;#ff3333&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;ESTIMATIVA_LEVES4.m&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;Essa função realiza as estimativas de emissão dos veículos leves&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#cc00cc&quot;&gt;OUTPUT:&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#cc00cc&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#cc00cc&quot;&gt;MATRIZ_LEVES&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#cc00cc&quot;&gt;EmissCityLeves&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="ellipse;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;strokeColor=#66FFFF;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="-1181.4" y="6640" width="523.75" height="540" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="raRQFdQsiKbz0KAO8EUM-38" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;&quot;&gt;Fator de Emissão (&lt;b&gt;CETESB&lt;/b&gt;)&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;font style=&quot;font-weight: bold;&quot; color=&quot;#33ff33&quot;&gt;Fonte:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#33ff33&quot;&gt;Fonte:&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;CETESB - Companhia Ambiental do Estado de SP&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;&quot; color=&quot;#33ff33&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;https://cetesb.sp.gov.br/veicular/relatorios-e-publicacoes/&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;PASTA:&amp;nbsp;&lt;font color=&quot;#ffb570&quot;&gt;\EMISSIONS_FACTORS_CETESB\&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#ffb570&quot;&gt;EF_Evaporative_LigthCommercial\&lt;/font&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;EF_Evaporative_LightCommercial.xlsx&lt;/span&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#ffb570&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#ffb570&quot;&gt;EF_Evaporative_LigthDuty&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#ffb570&quot;&gt;\&lt;/font&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;EF_Evaporative_LightDuty.xlsx&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#ffb570&quot;&gt;EF_Evaporative_MotorCycle&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;font color=&qu