        <mxCell id="AqRepBtH8KAMyQBKXLAv-1" value="&lt;font color=&quot;#ff3333&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;ProbCOMB_MOTOS.m&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;div&gt;Esta função faz a probabilidade entre os&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;anos modelos, considerando&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;os grupos de combustível &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;para a categoria das&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Motos&lt;/b&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;Exemplo:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;Entre os anos de 2003 e 2009&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;existem fatores de emissão a&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;penas para motos a Gasolina. Então deve-se considerar que o total de motos é apenas aquelas movidas a gasolina.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;Entre os anos de 2010 e 2017, existem fatores de emissão para veículos à Gasolina, Flex Gasolina e Flex Etanol.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;Então a nova proporção da probabilidade é considerando motos que consomem Gasolina, Flex Gasolina e Flex Etanol&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#cc00cc&quot;&gt;OUTPUT:&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#cc00cc&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#cc00cc&quot;&gt;FUELTYPE_MOTOS2003&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#cc00cc&quot;&gt;FUELTYPE_MOTOS2010&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div