        <mxCell id="AqRepBtH8KAMyQBKXLAv-98" value="&lt;br&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;forced-color-adjust: none; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Helvetica; font-size: 18px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: center; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(251, 251, 251); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;forced-color-adjust: none; font-size: 18px;&quot;&gt;EQUAÇÃO (para cada categoria):&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;forced-color-adjust: none; color: rgb(204, 0, 204); font-size: 18px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br style=&quot;forced-color-adjust: none; font-size: 18px;&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;forced-color-adjust: none; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Helvetica; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: center; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(251, 251, 251); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;forced-color-adjust: none; color: rgb(204, 0, 204);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 18px;&quot;&gt;EmissCityMP_RESSUSPENSAO&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 18px;&quot;&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 18px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 18px; forced-color-adjust: none;&quot;&gt;Prob do combustivel x da categoria z * Prob do ano modelo y * consumo de combustivel * Autonomia * Fator de emissao de desgaste de RESSUSPENSAO&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br style=&quot;forced-color-adjust: none; font-size: 18px;&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;forced-color-adjust: none; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Helvetica; font-size: 18px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: center; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(251, 251, 251); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;br style=&quot;forced-color-adjust: none;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;forced-color-adjust: none; font-size: 18px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br style=&quot;forced-color-adjust: none;&quot;&gt;OBS: O consumo de Combustivel ja foi feita a multiplicação pela proporção de consumo na categoria na funcção:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;forced-color-adjust: none; background-color: initial; text-align: center; color: rgb(255, 51, 51);&quot;&gt;Segregacao_ConsumosCOMB.m.&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;forced-color-adjust: none; background-color: initial; text-align: center;&quot;&gt;E também esta sendo considerado o consumo destinado ao transporte rodoviaruio realizado na função&lt;/span&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;forced-color-adjust: none; background-color: initial; text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;forced-color-adjust: none; color: rgb(255, 51, 51); background-color: initial; text-align: center;&quot;&gt;CombustívelTransportes_BEN.m&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="shape=hexagon;perimeter=hexagonPerimeter2;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fixedSize=1;" vertex="1" parent="1">
